The Redis command catalog and the write-command catalog
(META-INF/redis-commands and META-INF/redis-write-commands) are derived from
microsphere-redis, as are the concepts of the non-intrusive Redis command
interception and the Kafka-based cross-datacenter command replication. This
product is an independent implementation: the interception is rebuilt on
Redisson (instead of the Spring Data Redis connection proxy), the commands are
captured from the Netty connection pipeline through the Redisson NettyHook
with wire-ready argument encoding, the write commands are replicated through
Kafka and replayed semantically through the Redisson CommandAsyncExecutor.
